( FRACT-OV ------ OVERLAY PREFIX -------------------   8-13-85)                                                                 VOCABULARY FRACT IMMEDIATE                                                                                                      71 OPEN-OVERLAY                                                                                                                 FRACT DEFINITIONS                                                                                                               2500 TRANS-ALLOT NEWT-DP                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ( FRACT-OV   CONSTANTS  & VARIABLES                    8-05-85)      V: XYANCHOR ( x,y abs anchor flag)                              V: STD      ( standard deviation range)                        2V: RATIO    ( internal roughness control)                  -128 C: FNULL    ( fractal null value)                                                                                          V: DY>1  ( delta y is > 1 flag)                                 V: DX>1  ( delta x is > 1 flag)                                 V: XO' ( translated origin - abs)                               V: YO' ( translated origin - abs)                               V: SCELL ( seg address for current cell)                        V: OCELL ( off address for current cell)                        20882 32767 2C: MERCATOR-RATIO                                           117 C: MERCATOR-SCALE                                                                                                                                                                  ( FRACT-OV   CONSTANTS  & VARIABLES                    8-05-85)                                                                 V: RT0   ( return addr holder)                                  V: RT1   ( return addr holder)                                  V: RTEMP ( return stack pointer holder)                         V: TY    ( temp variable for xshift, yshift)                    EXIT                                                             2 C= FY2    ( frame offset for y2)                              4 C= FX2    ( frame offset for x2)                              6 C= FY1    ( frame offset for y1)                              8 C= FX1    ( frame offset for x1)                             10 C= FYMID  ( frame offset for ymid)                           12 C= FXMID  ( frame offset for xmid)                           14 C= FSTD   ( frame offset for std)                                                                                                                                                            ( FRACT-OV   SETSCALE GENANCHORS                      11-19-84)                                                                 HEAD: SETSCALE ( dratio scale -- \ set )                          ( deviation change ratio and scale)                           T:  STD ! RATIO 2! T;                                                                                                           HEAD: GENANCHORS ( -- All Aul Aur Alr \ )                         ( generate 4 anchor points)                                   T:  4 0 DO STD @ DUP NEGATE SWAP RRND                                 LOOP T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ( FRACT-OV   [RRND]  C+LIMIT                           8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: [RRND] -2 DP +!                                                        ( lo hi rtn -- n \ generate a random # in the )         ( range lo to hi)                                               8B C, 06 C, SEED , B9 C, BD C, 7A C, F7 C, E9 C, 05 C, 0F C,    1B C, 89 C, 06 C, SEED , 5A C, 5B C, 59 C, 52 C, 2B C, D9 C,    F7 C, E3 C, 03 C, D1 C, 58 C, 52 C, 50 C, C3 C,                                                                               V: C+LIMIT -2 DP +!                                                        ( c c rtn -- c \ add 2 bytes, clipping to limits)      5B C, 58 C, 59 C, 03 C, C1 C, 3D C, 7F C, 00 C, 7E C, 03 C,     B8 C, 7F C, 00 C, 3D C, 81 C, FF C, 79 C, 03 C, B8 C, 81 C,     FF C, 50 C, 53 C, C3 C,                                                                                                       DECIMAL                                                         ( FRACT-OV   DISPLACEMNT                               8-14-85) HEX V: DISPLACEMNT -2 DP +! ( xrel yrel rtn -- n \ gen a)         ( fractal displacement given relative location w/ optional)     ( fixed seeds to make fractal stationary)                       5B C, 58 C, 59 C, 53 C, 8B C, 16 C, XYANCHOR , 0B C, D2 C,      7E C, 50 C, 03 C, 0E C, XO' , 03 C, 06 C, YO' ,  79 C, 09 C,    40 C, F7 C, D8 C, 81 C, C1 C, 80 C, 04 C, EB C, 12 C, BA C,     C0 C, 03 C, 3B C, C2 C, 78 C, 0B C, 2B C, C2 C, F7 C, D8 C,     03 C, C2 C, 40 C, 81 C, C1 C, 80 C, 04 C, 89 C, 06 C, SEED ,    51 C, B8 C, 01 C, 00 C, 50 C, F7 C, D8 C, 50 C, E8 C,           [RRND] HERE 2+ - ,  59 C,  8F C, 06 C, SEED , 51 C,  B8 C,      01 C, 00 C, 50 C, F7 C, D8 C, 50 C, E8 C, [RRND]                HERE 2+ - ,  58 C, 59 C, 33 C, 06 C, GLOBALSEED , 33 C, C1 C,   89 C, 06 C, SEED , 8B C, 46 C, 0E C, 8B C, C8 C, F7 C, D9 C,    51 C, 50 C, E8 C, [RRND] HERE 2+ - , 58 C, 59 C, 50 C, 51 C,    C3 C, DECIMAL                                                 ( FRACT-OV   [SWRAP]                                   8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: [SWRAP] -2 DP +!                                                             ( x y rtn -- x'y' \ calc new array cell coords)   ( using spherical wrap)                                         5A C, 58 C, 59 C, 0B C, C0 C, 79 C, 0F C, 40 C, F7 C, D8 C,     8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY , 8B C, 1F C, D1 C, EB C, 03 C, CB C,        EB C, 1C C, 8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY , 8B C, 5F C, 02 C, 3B C,        C3 C, 78 C, 11 C, 2B C, C3 C, F7 C, D8 C, 03 C, C3 C, 40 C,     8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY , 8B C, 1F C, D1 C, EB C, 03 C, CB C,        0B C, C9 C, 79 C, 08 C, 8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY , 03 C, 0F C,        EB C, 0C C, 8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY ,  8B C, 1F C, 3B C, CB C,       78 C, 02 C, 2B C, CB C, 51 C, 50 C, 52 C, C3 C,               DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   [ACELLADDR]                               8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: [ACELLADDR] -2 DP +! ( x y rtn -- \ compute array )            ( cell address with optional spherical boundary wrapping)       8F C, 06 C, RT0 ,  8B C, 06 C, SPHEREWRAP ,  0B C, C0 C,        7E C, 03 C, E8 C, [SWRAP] HERE 2+ - , 8B C, 1E C, 'ARRAY ,      8B C, 47 C, 06 C, 8B C, 5F C, 04 C, 59 C, D1 C, E1 C, 03 C,     D9 C, 1E C, 8E C, D8 C, 8B C, 0F C, 1F C, 5A C, 03 C, CA C,     89 C, 06 C, SCELL ,  89 C, 0E C, OCELL , FF C, 36 C,            RT0 ,  C3 C,                                                  DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   [A@]                                      8-12-85)                                                                 HEX                                                             V: [A@] -2 DP +! ( rtn -- c or n \ long byte fetch with )         ( optional sign extension for current array cell)               5A C, 8B C, 1E C, OCELL , 1E C, FF C, 36 C, SCELL ,             1F C, 8A C, 07 C, 1F C, 8B C, 0E C, SIGNEXTEND ,                0B C, C9 C, 7E C, 03 C, 98 C, EB C, 02 C, 32 C, E4 C,           50 C, 52 C, C3 C,                                             DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   !HEIGHT   [!HEIGHT]                       8-12-85)                                                                 HEX                                                             V: [!HEIGHT] -2 DP +!                                                        ( val x y rtn -- \ set height in current array)      ( if value of cell xy is null)                                  8F C, 06 C, RT1 ,  E8 C, [ACELLADDR] HERE 2+ - , E8 C, [A@]     HERE 2+ - ,  58 C,  3D C, FNULL ,  75 C, 10 C, 58 C, 1E C,      FF C, 36 C, SCELL , 8B C, 1E C, OCELL , 1F C, 88 C, 07 C,       1F C, EB C, 01 C, 58 C, FF C, 36 C, RT1 ,  C3 C,                                                                              V: !HEIGHT -2 DP +! ( val x y -- \ see [!height]) HERE DUP 2- !   E8 C, [!HEIGHT] HERE 2+ - , AD C, 8B C, D8 C, FF C, 27 C,     DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   SETANCHORS                                8-06-85)                                                                 HEAD: SETANCHORS                                                             ( All Aul Aur Alr \ set anchor pts for region.)    T:  XUR @ YLL @ !HEIGHT                                           XUR @ YUR @ !HEIGHT                                             XLL @ YUR @ !HEIGHT                                             XLL @ YLL @ !HEIGHT T;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ( FRACT-OV   XSHIFT                                    8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: XSHIFT -2 DP +! ( y rtn -- \ displace midpt of x1,y x2,y)      59 C, 8F C, 06 C, TY , 51 C, FF C, 76 C, 08 C, FF C, 36 C,      TY , E8 C, [ACELLADDR] HERE 2+ - , E8 C, [A@] HERE 2+ - ,       FF C, 76 C, 04 C, FF C, 36 C, TY , E8 C, [ACELLADDR] HERE       2+ - ,  E8 C, [A@] HERE 2+ - , 58 C, 59 C, 03 C, C1 C,          D1 C, F8 C, 50 C, 8B C, 5E C, 08 C, 03 C, 5E C, 04 C, D1 C,     FB C, 53 C, FF C, 36 C, TY , E8 C, DISPLACEMNT HERE 2+ - ,      E8 C, C+LIMIT HERE 2+ - , FF C, 76 C, 0C C, FF C, 36 C, TY ,    E8 C, [!HEIGHT] HERE 2+ - , C3 C,                             DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   YSHIFT                                    8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: YSHIFT -2 DP +! ( x rtn -- \ displace midpt of x,y1 x,y2)      59 C, 8F C, 06 C, TY , 51 C, FF C, 36 C, TY , FF C, 76 C,       06 C, E8 C, [ACELLADDR] HERE 2+ - , E8 C, [A@] HERE 2+ - ,      FF C, 36 C, TY , FF C, 76 C, 02 C, E8 C, [ACELLADDR] HERE       2+ - ,  E8 C, [A@] HERE 2+ - , 58 C, 59 C, 03 C, C1 C,          D1 C, F8 C, 50 C, FF C, 36 C, TY , 8B C, 5E C, 06 C,            03 C, 5E C, 02 C, D1 C, FB C, 53 C, E8 C, DISPLACEMNT HERE      2+ - , E8 C, C+LIMIT HERE 2+ - , FF C, 36 C, TY , FF C,         76 C, 0A C,  E8 C, [!HEIGHT] HERE 2+ - , C3 C,                DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( FRACT-OV   EDGES                                     8-12-85) HEX                                                             V: EDGES -2 DP +! ( -- \ compute heights for edge midpoints)      8B C, 06 C, DY>1 ,  0B C, C0 C, 7E C, 11 C, 8B C, 46 C, 08 C,   0B C, C0 C, 75 C, 04 C, 50 C, E8 C, YSHIFT HERE 2+ - ,          FF C, 76 C, 04 C, E8 C, YSHIFT HERE 2+ - ,  8B C, 06 C, DX>1 ,  0B C, C0 C, 7E C, 11 C, 8B C, 46 C, 06 C, 0B C, C0 C, 75 C,     04 C, 50 C, E8 C, XSHIFT HERE 2+ - ,  FF C, 76 C, 02 C,         E8 C, XSHIFT HERE 2+ - , C3 C,                                DECIMAL                                                                                                         